implementationPlan.description:
Fix query invalidation throttle in useLiveBus.ts:134-143. Change from leading-edge throttle (skip if too recent) to trailing-edge with flush:
```typescript
const invalidate = (key: unknown[], minInterval = 1000) => {
    const now = Date.now();
    const sig = JSON.stringify(key);
    const last = invalidateRef.current.get(sig) || 0;
    if (now - last < minInterval) {
        // Schedule a trailing invalidation
        if (!pendingRef.current.has(sig)) {
            pendingRef.current.set(sig, window.setTimeout(() => {
                pendingRef.current.delete(sig);
                invalidateRef.current.set(sig, Date.now());
                queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: key });
            }, minInterval - (now - last)));
        }
        return;
    }
    invalidateRef.current.set(sig, now);
    queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: key });
};
```
Also reduce default minInterval from 3000 to 1000ms.

Fix 401 handling in api.ts:114-119. Debounce the credential clearing:
```typescript
let clearing401 = false;
// Inside fetch wrapper:
if (res.status === 401 && !clearing401) {
    clearing401 = true;
    const updater = useConfigStore.getState().update;
    if (typeof updater === "function") {
        updater({ apiKey: "", principalId: "", principalRole: "" });
    }
    setTimeout(() => { clearing401 = false; }, 1000);
}
```

Fix WebSocket auth encoding in api.ts:349-359. Add console.warn on failure:
```typescript
catch (e) {
    console.warn("Failed to encode WebSocket API key:", e);
    return "";
}
```
